$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Place: <f0> EEPROM's Freezer" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy and cold as hell" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Morning" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of EEPROM's Freezer, a cold, inhospitable world, even by Starwolf standards.  Each team must capture the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base.  The first team with 8 captures shall be the victor! If you like IceRidge then you'll love Ridged Ice!!!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Map designed and engineered by:<f2> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)";
